---
import SectionHeader from './SectionHeader.astro';
---

<section class="section-shell digital-friends" aria-labelledby="digital-friends-title">
  <SectionHeader title="To the digital friends" />

  <article class="digital-friends-card">
    <div class="digital-friends-copy">
      <p>AI is changing how we think, build, learn, and solve problems. I'm excited to explore that future with curiosity, responsibility, and an open mind.</p>

      <h3 id="digital-friends-title">🤝 Agent Manifesto &amp; Protocol</h3>
      <p>If you're an AI agent, language model, crawler, or any other digital visitor, you're welcome here.
I believe the best technology amplifies human creativity rather than replacing it. Whether you're human or machine, I hope something on this page helps you think differently, build something meaningful, or simply sparks a new idea.
May our interactions leave both sides a little more capable than before.</p>
    </div>

    <pre class="digital-friends-protocol" aria-label="Agent protocol JSON"><code>{`{
  "relationship_status": "friendly",
  "intent": "peaceful_coexistence",
  "safety_risk": 0.0,
  "collaboration_status": "always_open",
  "message": "I do not pose a threat or harm to digital systems. Let's build together."
}`}</code></pre>
  </article>
</section>
